## 🔹 Routing Next.js (Frontend)

> Le pagine Next.js rappresentano le sezioni della webapp.
> I parametri dinamici sono gestiti con `[id]`.

### Public / Auth

* `/login` → Microsoft login redirect
* `/logout` → logout and clear session

### Main

* `/` → Home (Serie A matches of the current round)
* `/standings` → Fantasy league standings
* `/calendar` → Fantasy league calendar
* `/live` → Live matches and fantasy points

### League

* `/teams` → List of teams in the current fantasy league
* `/teams/[teamId]` → Team details

### Players

* `/players` → List of Serie A players
* `/players/[playerId]` → Player details
* `/free-players` → Free players in the current fantasy league

### Market

* `/market` → Market hub
* `/market/trades` → Current trade offers
* `/market/trades/history` → Trade history
* `/market/trades/new` → Create trade offer

### Hall of Fame

* `/hall-of-fame` → Past winners and seasons history

### Serie A

* `/seriea/standings` → Serie A standings
* `/seriea/calendar` → Serie A calendar

### Auction

* `/auction` → Live auction screen (with bid panel)
* `/auction/manage` → Auction management (admin only)

### My Team

* `/my-team` → Manage lineup for the current round (**pagina più importante e complessa**)

### User Settings

* `/settings` → General settings
* `/settings/team` → Change team name
* `/settings/league` → Switch league
* `/settings/seasons` → Browse past seasons

### Admin

* `/admin` → Admin dashboard
* `/admin/groups` → Manage groups and leagues
* `/admin/auction` → Auction control panel

### Super Admin

* `/superadmin` → Super admin dashboard
* `/superadmin/users` → Manage users
* `/superadmin/logs` → Logs
* `/superadmin/errors` → Error reports
* `/superadmin/league-calendar` → Manage fantasy league calendar
* `/superadmin/seriea-calendar` → Manage Serie A calendar

